Not in our modern, scientific world...

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.090
<i>No way, no way, no way!</i>

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.090
<i>I know.</i>

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.960
<i>I think I look like a wolf, 
but to everyone else,</i>

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.050
<i>I look like a normal person, 
and I'm just hallucinating.</i>

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.610
<i>It must be the mushrooms from 
my breakfast this morning!</i>

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.570
<i>That must be it!</i>

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.040
<i>I'm just hallucinating!</i>

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:53.740
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.070
What are you?

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.830
Yer not human.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.940
<i>Chiro... I guess she doesn't 
recognize me with this face.</i>

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.310
<i>Crap! I need to hide.</i>

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.060
<i>That freaked me out.</i>

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.400
<i>What was that?</i>

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.320
Shiba-kun.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:30.070
The president wants to look for 
the source of the Oomizu spring.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.300
Let's go before it gets dark...

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.450
Huh?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.070
He's not here.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:37.330
You two! It's an emergency!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.510
There's a wolf in the inn!

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:40.250
What?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.180
There's a wolf?

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.150
Seriously?

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.080
Scary.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.700
Is there really a wolf?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.700
Please calm down, everyone.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.710
Someone must've been mistaken.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:51.480
It seems there have been sightings 
of a wolfman, as well.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.460
Really?

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:53.760
Either way,

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.680
we won't be able to use the 
mixed bath for a while now.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:02.060
The legendary wolf has finally 
appeared before us.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.320
We were able to hear the account of a witness

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.280
who encountered the wolf.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.750
It wasn't an encounter.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.220
She said it attacked her.

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:14.200
An employee said other people saw it, too.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.600
Yep, yep.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.700
It may be some kind of bear.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:22.050
We decided to continue pursuing it.

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:26.600
We should've had the girls help us film.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.000
Let's catch that wolf on camera!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.920
Yes.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.590
We couldn't ask for a greater opportunity.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:35.600
Huh? By the way, where's that guy?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.780
I don't see him around...

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.310
Is everyone okay?

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.230
Now that I'm here, there's 
nothing to worry about!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.800
I'll get rid of that wolf!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.490
Help from the hunting club 
should be arriving shortly.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.740
Don't worry.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.090
How dependable.

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:57.780
Now we're safe.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.030
The wolf was spotted in the hallway.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.650
And in the inner courtyard.

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.480
Hey!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.920
We asked the police for help, too!

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.240
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.440
<i>Is this a nightmare,</i>

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:18.140
<i>or am I being punished for 
all the bad things I've done?</i>

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.110
<i>Is that what this is?</i>

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.060
<i>God...</i>

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:24.880
<i>Please!</i>

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.280
<i>With this body, I can't go on dates,
 or walk to school,</i>

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.060
<i>or go shopping, or do anything with girls!</i>

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:30.760
<i>I won't do anything anymore.</i>

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.800
<i>I'll live an ordinary life.</i>

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.680
<i>I'll live like a saint, so please.</i>

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:38.870
<i>Give me back my human body!</i>

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.990
<i>This can't be real...</i>

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.620
I can see it through the 
window of the futon room!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:17:59.590
It's the wolf!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:00.970
Old woman, the rifle!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.060
<i>Oh, no. How can I explain this?</i>

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:07.690
<i>I can't.</i>

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:11.400
<i>With this body, they won't believe anything I say.</i>

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:15.620
<i>Besides, I can't even talk anymore.</i>

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.740
<i>I know! The tickets!</i>

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.980
<i>I'm so dumb! Why didn't I think of that before?</i>

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:27.140
<i>I can't tear one off with these paws!</i>

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:32.630
It's outside!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.140
Go after it!

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:35.730
There it is!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.560
Over there!

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.380
Don't let it escape!

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.080
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.880
<i>Am I going to spend the rest of my life</i>

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:43.180
<i>living in the mountains as a wolf?</i>

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:44.100
<i>Mom...</i>

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.020
<i>Seitaro...</i>

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.490
<i>Rurumo...</i>

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:00.990
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.450
<i>Do you recognize...</i>

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.610
Hey, miss!

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:10.040
Did the wolf go that way?

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.150
<i>Rurumo...</i>

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.840
That way.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.900
All right! It went that way!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:20.980
Damn wolf!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.430
We'll get that critter good!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.430
Are you okay?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.550
Miss, head back to the inn.

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:26.390
Let's go, everyone.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.940
They're gone. Come out.

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:37.900
Why are you surprised?

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:45.740
Fool.

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.530
I would never fail to recognize my contractor.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.580
Use your tickets, quickly.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.820
Did you forget?

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.720
The tickets respond to your powerful desires.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.220
I will use restorative magic

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.810
before your heart becomes that of a wolf.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.200
I wouldn't want a wolf for a contractor, either.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.830
Now, wish.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.350
Ribal!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:43.470
Rurumo...

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:02.420
So it turns out we just mistook a dog for a wolf.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.630
I'm sorry.

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:06.160
I was so scared, I...

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.480
I'm just glad nothing happened.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:09.410
Yeah.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.410
Nothing happened this time, either.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.860
It's best when nothing happens.

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.670
An ordinary life is the best life!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.360
Are there no mysteries in this world?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.230
We've searched so hard for them.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:32.600
The mysteries may be closer than you think.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:34.110
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:35.270
You're spot-on.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.520
The next episode is "Girls' Band Formed."

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: Girls' Band Formed</b>

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:32.300
That sounds fun.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Watch again!</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Yah!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Huff

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b><i>Wiff</i></b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Illustration by Watanabe Wataru</b>
